OL,3,GNEWSACanal killer who dismembered
OL,4,Avictims dies in jail
OL,5,
OL,6,FA double killer who murdered and
OL,7,Fdismembered two women before dumping
OL,8,Ftheir bodies in canals in London and
OL,9,Fthe Netherlands has died in prison.
OL,11,FJohn Sweeney, 69, was serving a
OL,12,Fwhole-life sentence after being
OL,13,Fconvicted in 2011 of the murders of his
OL,14,Fformer girlfriends.
OL,16,FPaula Fields, 31, was killed in London.
OL,17,FParts of her body were found in six
OL,18,Fholdalls floating in Regent's Canal in
OL,19,FCamden in February 2001. Her head,
OL,20,Fhands and feet were never recovered.
